azy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing bolt (1a) and remove the tensioner (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244002448.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the tensioner and tighten the fixing bolt to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/244000559.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Value - daNm</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>2,5</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>MOBILE TIMING TENSIONER</p></td><td><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing bolt.</p><p>- Remove the timing belt moving tensioner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244002449.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the timing belt moving tensioner.</p><p>- Screw in the fixing bolt without tightening it to torque.</p>"]]